    "detailed_description": "<i>Curses aren't real... everybody knows that.</i><br><br>Right?<br><br>Siobhan finds herself alone after the mysterious death of her friend.<br><br>As she attempts to move on, things begin to unravel out of control.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436500/extras/92eee668dfe5eb7e7633786ed8d50fdc.poster.avif?t=1705683842\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436500/extras/92eee668dfe5eb7e7633786ed8d50fdc.webm?t=1705683842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436500/extras/92eee668dfe5eb7e7633786ed8d50fdc.mp4?t=1705683842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>trophies </i>is a visual novel about trust, truth and what to do with it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436500/extras/a6d28d0519c9b71a13b463fd4d7e848a.avif?t=1705683842\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436500/extras/f211f578ec763a9cf90c88cd46bcd494.avif?t=1705683842\" /></span><br><br>A quiet girl who keeps herself to herself.<br><br>Unfortunately, <strong>Siobhan's </strong>been forced into the spotlight as the sole witness to a fatal accident.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436500/extras/c052630c03e1a99765ed88da252ea073.avif?t=1705683842\" /></span><br><br>Strange, but harmless - <strong>Grace </strong>claims she's a witch.<br><br>But surely she can't be serious about it... Most girls grow out of pretending to be witches, don't they?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436500/extras/1796922891816c15d2f89742d4d3fa04.avif?t=1705683842\" /></span><br><br>An out-going, headstrong girl. <strong>Charlie'</strong>s a bassist in the local band, Devil Dog, with her two close friends.<br><br>As events unfold, she finds herself caught in the middle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436500/extras/824b4fb8399cc1b8da4e89df51c8b425.avif?t=1705683842\" /></span><br><br>Siobhan's best friend, and Grace's younger sister.<br><br><strong>Aisling </strong>is a cheerful girl who always looks forward to tomorrow.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436500/extras/74a661eb003464d8a3dcb3ed37002698.avif?t=1705683842\" /></span><br><br>Aisling's ex. <br><br><strong>Declan </strong>fancies himself a bit of a detective after watching too much TV.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436500/extras/dfa7aa0178c4ec9a8138459bc24a2876.avif?t=1705683842\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2D animation<br></li><li>30-35 thousand words<br></li><li>2-3 hour playtime<br></li><li>2008 Ireland</li></ul>",
